// Whisper bore — a machined bore that quiets the shot AND sharpens the aim: fits the Silenced
// tag PLUS a small Aim (Accuracy) bonus. GTW-549 FIXES the GTW-542 design error — the old
// WhisperBore steadied via a stability seam; a bore that helps you aim boosts AIM (the
// in-cone concentration), not recoil stability. Data-driven attachment ITEM; applied
// post-spawn. Referenced by a weapon BY KEY in its `attachments:` list.
(
    display_name: "Whisper Bore",
    effects: [
        Silence,    // the shot propagates neither suppression nor reaction/reveal
        Aim(0.2),   // a modest Accuracy bump (smaller than a full Scoped Sight) — tunable
    ],
)
